328
00:08:43,810 --> 00:08:44,690
Three.

329
00:08:44,690 --> 00:08:46,320
There's only so much room
in there.

330
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:47,870
Bending compresses it.

331
00:08:47,870 --> 00:08:49,860
